      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "God bless you this Bl. Feast. I started to write you several days ago but something thwarted my success in reaching you for this 51st anniv'y of my first full day in the Order Deo Gr. I've been checqued in my rush of work by weeping eczema; Thanks be to God for each and all of His designs. Was able however to attend Sol .- mid- ngt Mass and offer one holy Mass besides ... Deo Gr .! Feet are im- proving ... and otherwise am quite well.",
